{
  "version": "4.0.0",
  "language": "fr",
  "language_raw": "French",
  "source": "message/dat/French/script/class_c_05.dat",
  "paired_tbl": "message/dat/French/script/class_c_05.tbl",
  "matching": "TRAILING_MAX_SENTINEL",
  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "class_c_05_history_01",
      "hash64": "B67123804862792C",
      "text": "Bonjour, les enfants ! Alors, vous sentez-vous plus\\ninstruits qu’hier ?[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 71,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "class_c_05_history_02",
      "hash64": "B671268048627E45",
      "text": "À la base, je voulais qu’on continue à démêler\\nles passionnants mystères de l’Histoire, mais\\r\\nj’imagine que le contrôle vous a fatigués, non ?[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 144,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "class_c_05_history_03",
      "hash64": "B671258048627C92",
      "text": "Et ça fait pas de mal de vous proposer quelque\\nchose d’un peu plus amusant de temps en temps.[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "class_c_05_history_04",
      "hash64": "B671208048627413",
      "text": "Alors pour cette fois, je vais vous raconter\\nun vieux conte, qui se transmet à Paldea\\r\\ndepuis des lustres.[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 108,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "class_c_05_history_05",
      "hash64": "B6711F8048627260",
      "text": "C’est l’histoire d’un roi qui aimait plus que tout\\ncollectionner les trésors.[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "class_c_05_history_06",
      "hash64": "B671228048627779",
      "text": "Un jour, un marchand venu d’un pays à l’est de\\nPaldea se rendit à la cour du roi, ayant entendu\\r\\nparler de la prédilection de ce dernier pour\\r\\nles trésors provenant d’autres contrées.[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 143,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 187,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "class_c_05_history_07",
      "hash64": "B6712180486275C6",
      "text": "Le marchand présenta quatre trésors au roi.[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 43,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "class_c_05_history_08",
      "hash64": "B6712C8048628877",
      "text": "Il s’agissait d’une urne, d’une épée, de tablettes\\net de magatama.[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 66,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "class_c_05_history_09",
      "hash64": "B6712B80486286C4",
      "text": "Ces trésors étaient d’une grande rareté,\\net le roi fut transporté de joie.[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 74,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "class_c_05_history_10",
      "hash64": "B66D9E80485F6156",
      "text": "Il offrit alors au marchand une immense fortune\\net fit l’acquisition des quatre trésors.[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "class_c_05_history_11",
      "hash64": "B66D9F80485F6309",
      "text": "... Décidément, c’est toujours toi qui croises mon\\nregard au moment fatidique, [VAR 0x0100(0000)]...\\r\\nVoici donc une petite question pour toi.[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 79,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 130,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "class_c_05_history_12",
      "hash64": "B66D9C80485F5DF0",
      "text": "J’ai dit qu’il y avait des tablettes parmi les quatre\\ntrésors. De quel genre de tablettes s’agissait-il ?[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 105,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "class_c_05_select_01",
      "hash64": "E88A268926C1CF24",
      "text": "De tablettes en bois.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "class_c_05_select_02",
      "hash64": "E88A298926C1D43D",
      "text": "De tablettes tactiles.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "class_c_05_select_03",
      "hash64": "E88A288926C1D28A",
      "text": "De tablettes de chocolat.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "class_c_05_history_answer_01",
      "hash64": "4CAB7604AC3B14BD",
      "text": "Exactement ! Décidément, tes connaissances\\nsont infaillibles.[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 61,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "class_c_05_history_answer_02",
      "hash64": "4CAB7304AC3B0FA4",
      "text": "Bien sûr que non ! Tu dis ça pour amuser\\nla galerie ?[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 53,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "class_c_05_history_answer_03",
      "hash64": "4CAB7404AC3B1157",
      "text": "Bien sûr que non ! Tu dis ça pour amuser\\nla galerie ?[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 53,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "class_c_05_history_13",
      "hash64": "B66D9D80485F5FA3",
      "text": "Il s’agissait donc de tablettes en bois, qui étaient\\nautrefois utilisées comme support d’écriture\\r\\ndans certains pays situés à l’est de Paldea.[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 145,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "class_c_05_history_14",
      "hash64": "B66DA280485F6822",
      "text": "Comme vous le savez peut-être, elles ont peu à\\npeu disparu à partir de l’apparition du papier.[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "class_c_05_history_15",
      "hash64": "B66DA380485F69D5",
      "text": "Pour que ces tablettes en bois soient considérées\\ncomme un trésor, c’est qu’elles devaient être\\r\\nde très belle facture.\\c\\nOu peut-être que des enseignements d’une\\ngrande sagesse étaient inscrits dessus...[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 121,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 207,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "class_c_05_history_16",
      "hash64": "B66DA080485F64BC",
      "text": "Quoi qu’il en soit, le roi aurait sans doute jamais\\nimaginé ce qui allait se passer ce soir-là...[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "class_c_05_history_17",
      "hash64": "B66DA180485F666F",
      "text": "... car de terribles fléaux s’abattirent sur son\\nchâteau : en une seule nuit, tout fut rasé ![VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "class_c_05_history_18",
      "hash64": "B66DA680485F6EEE",
      "text": "... L’histoire est pas terminée, mais c’est déjà\\nl’heure... Dommage.[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 68,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "class_c_05_history_19",
      "hash64": "B66DA780485F70A1",
      "text": "Pour celles et ceux qui souhaiteraient connaître\\nla suite, venez me voir durant votre temps libre ![VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 99,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
